[Host] Forty-five percent.

70
00:09:40,943 --> 00:09:50,663
[Host] That's all for today. Next time you sit down to a Japanese meal, think about how far each ingredient traveled to reach the table. See you tomorrow.

71
00:09:51,264 --> 00:09:53,663
[News] また明日。
